TRELLIS Windows xformers patches
===============================

These two patches switch TRELLIS from flash-attn (unavailable on Windows)
to xformers as the attention backend. They must be applied after a fresh
`git submodule update --init TRELLIS` on Windows.

The launch script `scripts/launch_trellis_server.bat` applies them
automatically via `git apply` before starting the server.

Manual application::

    cd G:\TJ\BIM\TRELLIS
    git apply ../../trellis_server/xformers_windows.patch

Files patched:
  - trellis/modules/attention/__init__.py: BACKEND 'flash_attn' → 'xformers'
  - trellis/modules/sparse/__init__.py:    ATTN    'flash_attn' → 'xformers'

Note: `trellis_server/server.py` also sets `os.environ["ATTN_BACKEND"]="xformers"`
at runtime as a belt-and-suspenders measure, but the source patches are still
needed because some modules read the module-level constant before the env var
is checked.
